  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Enhance core functionality and add new features\n\n- Updated `Line` class with properties for angle, length, and radian calculations.\n- Modified `SharpBoxesCore.csproj` for NuGet package generation and added dependencies.\n- Introduced `PathHelper` class for path manipulation.\n- Created `ExcelExporter` class for Excel file conversions using `MiniExcelLibs`.\n- Updated `IExcelExporter` interface with new methods for data handling.\n- Added `BackgroundTaskManager` for managing background tasks with logging and progress.\n- Implemented `ILogger` interface and `ConsoleLogger` for logging capabilities.\n- Defined `ITaskResult` interface and `ETaskResultStatus` enum for task result handling.\n- Added `ProgressInfo` class for task progress updates.\n- Enhanced `TaskDefinition` class for flexible task management.\n- Introduced `RegularTaskId` class for task identification.\n- Implemented `ThreadPoolManager` for managing tasks with a thread pool.",
  "repository": "",
